# SDRdx

The SDRdx unit is a small sdr radio. 

It needs to fit in a 1U unit.

The bracket should be centered on the 1U front, the front 

- the unit is 98 x 93 x 33 mm.
- The front aparture should have a 4mm lip to hold the unit side and bottom, only a single mm on top.
- The shelf should have side fins and a stopper at the end, but for cabling, the stopper should only be 20mm long on the left (seen from front from front) and 30mm on the right (seen from front). 
- The datasheet is at https://www.sdr-kits.net/RSPdxDatasheetV1.0.pdf
- The antenna ports should be at the front.

